<pre class="metadata">
Title: IdP Registration API
Shortname: idp-registration
Level: None
Status: CG-DRAFT
Group: fedidcg
Repository: w3c-fedid/idp-registration
URL: https://w3c-fedid.github.io/idp-registration/
Editor: Sam Goto, w3cid 50308, Google Inc. https://google.com, goto@google.com
Abstract: This specification extends the Federated Credential Management API [[FEDCM]] so that
    identity providers can register themselves with the user agent, and relying parties can
    request <em>any</em> registered identity provider that speaks a protocol they accept, instead
    of enumerating identity providers. It also defines how the user agent resolves a handle typed by
    the user (e.g. <code>@alice.example</code>, <code>alice@social.example</code> or
    <code>https://alice.example</code>) into a registered identity provider.
